                <syl /><neume facs="#m-d876f91c-65c1-4789-8fcf-ff278e731db6" type="punctum" xml:id="m-29042cdd-2703-4288-9187-c6495b400de7">
                  <nc xml:id="m-4188e5fd-2ecc-4d2c-a43e-0dc8bbeaf2b4" pname="a" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-c9e1364c-4754-44c2-9c12-94d8c6602ad9">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-e6e56f13-5263-4eb8-bd1c-4c855b4595b8" type="clivis" xml:id="m-5cf77389-9e30-4a8f-8d49-4ab154f6fe95">
                  <nc xml:id="m-a9905e31-fbf9-4ece-beae-7140249624d5" pname="a" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-08bf55bd-1599-4b3f-bbe9-e009cadd471c" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-48667ebc-9b04-4809-84e0-5946c9a4f1b0" facs="#m-ed47810b-f58b-4526-b696-38e390636859" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-798aa831-c102-4b97-9c15-5affdb862958"><lg xml:id="m-2724edf3-2888-4cd9-82b0-bb8df7d96ba8"><l xml:id="m-55aac1ff-bbc7-4f83-8e7b-9071203df267" facs="#m-15ea1854-84d1-407d-bdde-0cda78c71284" label="ambiguous">1827</l><l xml:id="m-cc041398-812b-411d-80be-e7ed059c7984" facs="#m-457bdf63-12fd-4434-ad64-d52521174faa" label="ambiguous">Iune 30.</l><l xml:id="m-692a8ddf-7641-4029-b991-c549048f36f9" facs="#m-ee3ec91a-911d-4cf3-91c4-67707bef8574" label="lyrics-like">et dóctor génti¬</l><l xml:id="m-aed17d49-5e90-4d78-88e5-ca0d0abac17e" facs="#m-dc41fdb5-efe5-4c5c-8579-14706edaef7e" label="lyrics-like">inter-cé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f8f8797d-6269-4715-9ef9-7f444b4b0a70" facs="#m-0213e9b2-1d70-4c69-b488-f7baff930d25" label="lyrics-like">ve-ri-tá-tis,</l><l xml:id="m-f08c349a-26e2-45ec-ac90-2e9f09ac88b3" facs="#m-660b89d6-10ae-4a48-947a-ca497136abe1" label="ambiguous">um,</l><l xml:id="m-0707bd45-5da4-4bcc-9a93-f118e1a6c564" facs="#m-34e31999-2c3f-4af9-9ea4-c5a42ed3a626" label="lyrics-like">de “ pro nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-8ff7f3b2-3047-4cfc-b499-e4e55f619a5e" facs="#m-5145cc73-62d6-4b8c-997d-a65180a9d03b" label="ambiguous">Gospel. Ecce ego mitto vos. p. 1488. — Offertory. Mihi autem. p. 1806.</l><l xml:id="m-1504766c-8403-430d-b536-e161b995b30a" facs="#m-1985630a-c880-4c4e-884b-946bc0e69f2a" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-b95a92aa-8e75-4445-bbe8-ab268e343e11" facs="#m-c7de0d48-c1d9-4113-add8-931738a03d49" label="lyrics-like">H Póstoli tui Pauli précibus, Dó-linstitúto, gratióra fiant patrocinio</l><l xml:id="m-4af7b0e0-a9a1-43ea-94f9-b11376740a05" facs="#m-3c603c49-434d-460e-a476-41b705d912dc" label="lyrics-like">A mine, plebis tuae dona sanctí-supplicántis. Per Dóminum no¬</l><l xml:id="m-1e4d2664-961d-4d7d-aa0b-bb7806a3bcf6" facs="#m-7b80dd12-efdb-4a30-b2e1-3b5596faff38" label="ambiguous">fica: ut, quae tibi tuo grata sunt! strum.</l><l xml:id="m-5ffc37e9-7008-4379-b172-4cab8284e75b" facs="#m-a31dd02a-38bb-4b09-831d-0c234c27f5fb" label="lyrics-like">Of St. Peter. Secret. Ecclésiae tuae. p. 1384.</l><l xml:id="m-066290c1-ce4a-4126-a10f-c8f9281a00aa" facs="#m-2d8ecc1d-0571-4ce7-a565-d2cb6930166f" label="lyrics-like">Of St. John. Secret. Tua Dómine. p. 1502.</l><l xml:id="m-cdfd16dd-e5b1-4d37-8e34-f434f3880f33" facs="#m-01d1fe32-75f6-427e-bf4e-c3f6ed5b33f3" label="lyrics-like">Communton. Amen díco vóbis. p. 1206.</l><l xml:id="m-dabf7266-ee49-44ea-838d-9a22f92ba2c6" facs="#m-26a1014e-6481-470d-aafb-7ad7409b6a6b" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-e7cf4ce2-5ae5-488e-9ab6-84f79827b0cc" facs="#m-891c3483-d9fd-4e52-8c2a-cab250e73424" label="lyrics-like">DErcéptis, Dómine, sacraméntis :] illius celebráta sunt glória, nobis</l><l xml:id="m-7104fc91-41eb-412b-b9aa-5c2a607a4327" facs="#m-bd9aa3b1-1b21-4540-a4a6-9bc7760d0bc9" label="lyrics-like">Lbeáto Paulo Apóstolo tuo inter- proficiant ad medélam. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-61827a5a-616d-42f0-aa21-aa24b7ec4950" facs="#m-6e65030a-0e80-41f4-9d1b-cf45f14cf315" label="lyrics-like">veniénte, deprecámur; ut, quae prol minum.</l><l xml:id="m-efd6af2c-11fe-4b4b-a675-8a765086a916" facs="#m-0349e3b9-5219-4b4f-a8ad-a70fbb35d561" label="text-like">of St. Peter. Postcommunion. Laetificet nos. p. 1384.</l><l xml:id="m-3ec8c112-d00a-49e9-9871-9d836d412244" facs="#m-ec6eeec2-0a4d-42d5-a987-7b31c597fcd8" label="lyrics-like">orst. John. Postcommunion. Sumat Ecclésia. p. 1502.</l><l xml:id="m-7b5c16c8-a58f-4748-bf0b-1e038ba7c009" facs="#m-5431a007-c09d-44fb-a7c5-d548e8818b50" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-746d9e87-51f0-4845-aafa-80dcc1ece7e4" facs="#m-93ea4b9c-748c-4bf1-894a-9743fd3e06be" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Grátia Déi. p. 1348</l><l xml:id="m-ca73ef44-5b8b-4cca-80ad-64128b86491d" facs="#m-e58f9d49-501d-4b2d-8b81-96f51cc383c6" label="ambiguous">2. Cor. 12. b.</l><l xml:id="m-039d3eb9-9852-4f59-9eeb-a875921181ff" facs="#m-f952dc42-af46-4219-b8e6-adc2ffa0d43d" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-16714c35-54dd-4923-9c83-60912793f0d9" facs="#m-ddf3a61b-0a71-4ae7-8e68-56393ad107ab" label="lyrics-like">DE magnitúdo revelatiónum ex- ter Dóminum rogávi, ut discéderet</l><l xml:id="m-8d4da916-d4cf-461d-af73-87e161cf139e" facs="#m-fafd19d9-c2f2-4fdc-b74f-ad4001050386" label="lyrics-like">10 tóllat me, datus est mihi sti¬</l><l xml:id="m-605ec90d-75be-4008-b0ec-b6964591a209" facs="#m-8c7e674d-b14e-42ca-ad14-013ec395e48f" label="lyrics-like">a me:*et dixit mihi : Súfficit tibi</l><l xml:id="m-53b7727b-766b-4715-b8d1-04a729002a3c" facs="#m-15214b64-13da-4759-927d-a70be2b9f270" label="lyrics-like">grátia mea.</l><l xml:id="m-8f8d76b0-8853-4f47-bacf-128145a5d58d" facs="#m-e0c3a12d-005d-42a4-9b46-64460c124a9d" label="lyrics-like">mulus carnis meae, ángelus sátanae,</l><l xml:id="m-aee6f773-8a24-43e6-8991-335f67543c5d" facs="#m-41a25c2c-afa3-4474-822f-49a606645726" label="ambiguous">qui me colaphizet. t Propter quod</l><l xml:id="m-e828603e-6129-41d2-b41f-2791b49e6d83" facs="#m-f5835937-d2aa-4358-91b0-9011ed3b30ac" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Constitues éos. p. 1521. W. Nimis honoráti sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-ee3f1bda-2e97-458e-841c-06d6ef2403b0" facs="#m-da6f0814-b65d-4105-a6e2-b9322c35fe6c" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-023921fa-fd42-4869-a97b-af8d83c2d825" facs="#m-94809d32-350e-48f3-b603-7f907a5e7138" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Ter vírgis caésus sum. p. 1349.</l><l xml:id="m-63f16acc-f8f6-4481-85ac-37fbb7597817" facs="#m-cac7a4a3-4bcd-4507-bc90-34c3961ef0af" label="ambiguous">1. Cor. 15. b.</l><l xml:id="m-c89412b8-ca3d-480f-ae72-d185ebed3c32" facs="#m-0b0c4a26-28cb-45ea-ac72-adac5783a3d0" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-ab5a7946-cf8b-4c5d-a576-fbf0a56b3208" facs="#m-4a7a81e7-3f6c-47fb-b0eb-4a1cc25faeeb" label="lyrics-like">YGO enim sum mínimus Aposto-l sum Ecclésiam Dei. 1 Grátia autem</l><l xml:id="m-ac0f6c41-2b68-44cc-a7e6-8231ad88cb5a" facs="#m-247a4363-b3b4-4612-8ccf-f034a2f0eb31" label="lyrics-like">U lórum, qui non sum dignus vo¬ Dei sum id quod sum, “et grátia</l><l xml:id="m-575c5981-4f7f-4951-89b0-2e987aa771f6" facs="#m-9d41924e-81be-4dc4-8395-2486790b0e45" label="lyrics-like">cári Apóstolus, quóniam persecútus! ejus in me vácua non fuit</l><l xml:id="m-d5f8f2fa-8a1f-4e03-875a-783a719f4b7b" facs="#m-e12ddba0-9fb3-4302-9742-524293ce582c" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Nimis honoráti sunt. p. 1522. V. Annuntiavérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-d25adb3f-0c77-4cae-b21a-0e4199c9ae77" facs="#m-464fa548-b3a5-4d4d-b162-e24d26d6036c" label="text-like">Vespers of the Precious Blood.</l><l xml:id="m-90329252-ae9e-4e38-a09c-27d9042f06bf" facs="#m-ab227ae1-6f43-45d7-aa84-005d8b122e7d" label="text-like">TIn churches dedicated to St. Paul where the second Vespers or St. Paul</l><l xml:id="m-838a3813-56cf-41ab-b4dd-b037138f8125" facs="#m-fee1df6e-541d-428e-b60a-1d880c578bad" label="text-like">are celebrated, the Antiphons and Psalms are from the Common ot Apostles.</l><l xml:id="m-76d5e983-f9f4-4e63-8d95-92cc43e52886" facs="#m-1017bb98-66c5-4c6c-b3a0-27087408c7fc" label="text-like">21114. Chapter, Hymn. Y. and H., Antiphon of Magnificat, Prayer, ana</l><l xml:id="m-0eb4e14d-25f3-46ec-9d84-434acae5e03b" facs="#m-6dc6d70f-9fc4-412f-9542-5f1ab09c3644" label="text-like">Commemoration or Si. Peter as at first Vespers, p. 1525. A commemoratio¬</l><l xml:id="m-73608319-9ea0-41aa-bb5d-ea1eddaa3142" facs="#m-4d6af038-1ca9-49cd-9c2b-8b10278baf30" label="text-like">is then made or the Precious Blood. Ant Asistis. p. 1528. V. Redemisti.</l><l xml:id="m-3a97af01-5ae0-4293-bd8f-1a047f3296a1" facs="#m-919b14a9-2fbd-4903-8458-a7562ce5373e" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Omnípotens. p. 1533.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>